It doesn't always work out well, but if you have near or below 0 AC and
50 HP (and hopefully skilled in a weapon) you can map the first level
(two if you find your HP staying up) on the mines. That's a great way to
get daggers, arrows, darts and crossbow bolts anlong with the applicable
weapon for them. Sometimes I even go to minetown for the altar to BUC
things if it's going well. But be warned, it *is* tougher than most of
the trip to sokoban due to it's open nature - more monsters and less
places to face only one monster at a time. With a very small amount of
luck though, you can get a pickaxe, blindfold/towel, key/lockpick and
maybe even a uncursed bag. Armor is good there too.

